        "supported": true,
        "reason": "Independently read all four cited canonical ranges. They establish encoding selection and caching, ROM reading and decoding into caller storage, character mapping, sheet expansion, and glyph texel/texture/width access. CARDFormatAsync passes OSGetFontEncode to regional formatting; VerifyID compares it against the stored encoding. The broader purpose usefully corrects the inherited encoding-only scope without contradicting functionality.md. Existing supported names and retained knowledge remain unchanged."
      }
